                                "text": "It's a movie created solely for the legions of teen and younger Bieberites (or whatever they call themselves), and a chance for them to see their icon in all the glory of three-dimensions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a350d860-5793-4cfc-8b4a-b53b32c830e6",
